    {
      "id": "p0145-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Similar measurement changes can be found throughout Undertale's Japanese script. In some cases, when the measurements aren't meant to be taken literally to begin with, the translator chose a suitable replacement. For example, a character in Snowdin shares this remark:",
        "raw": "Similar measurement changes can be found throughout Undertale's Japanese\nscript. In some cases, when the measurements aren't meant to be taken literally\nto begin with, the translator chose a suitable replacement. For example, a\ncharacter in Snowdin shares this remark:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0920954,
          0.62001429,
          0.70493616,
          0.68744286
